1
00:01:05,220 --> 00:01:07,020
Hey, what are you up to tonight?

2
00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:10,820
Nothing much. I was gonna stay in and catch up on some sleep.

3
00:01:11,220 --> 00:01:14,620
Come on, you can sleep when you're old. Let's hang out.

4
00:01:15,220 --> 00:01:18,820
Fine, but I'm not staying out late. I've got work in the morning.

5
00:01:19,220 --> 00:01:21,420
Deal. First round's on me.

6
00:04:40,220 --> 00:04:42,020
So, how did the date go?

7
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:44,820
Honestly? It was a total disaster.

8
00:04:45,220 --> 00:04:47,820
She spent the whole night on her phone.

9
00:04:48,220 --> 00:04:50,820
Ouch. Did you at least split the bill?

10
00:04:51,220 --> 00:04:53,920
Nope. I picked up the tab, like an idiot.

11
00:04:54,220 --> 00:04:57,020
Don't beat yourself up. It happens to everyone.

12
00:08:12,220 --> 00:08:14,020
Wait, is that who I think it is?

13
00:08:14,220 --> 00:08:16,920
No way. I haven't seen her since college.

14
00:08:17,220 --> 00:08:20,820
You should go say hi. What's the worst that could happen?

15
00:08:21,220 --> 00:08:23,920
She could pretend she doesn't remember me.

16
00:08:24,220 --> 00:08:26,820
Just play it cool. Don't overthink it.

17
00:12:31,220 --> 00:12:34,820
I can't believe I ran into her after all these years.

18
00:12:35,220 --> 00:12:37,920
And? Are you gonna ask her out or not?

19
00:12:38,220 --> 00:12:40,920
I don't know. I don't want to rush things.

20
00:12:41,220 --> 00:12:43,920
Dude, you've been saying that for ten years.

21
00:12:44,220 --> 00:12:46,120
Okay, okay. I'll text her tomorrow.

22
00:12:46,220 --> 00:12:47,120
Promise?

23
00:12:47,220 --> 00:12:50,420
I promise. Now can we please call it a night?

